  beats:
  - heading: The Bluff
    text: '"By the king''s order, no one leaves."


      Jonathan lifts his hand.
      His father''s signet ring catches the flame. The commander steps aside, and
      the gate groans open.'
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d9970ad33f1ff6499e6b31fb9a75ab3, type: 3}
